# Fang-Druid Summoner: "you may search your library and/or graveyard". Bot1 wheels Grizzly Bears, Llanowar Elves and Ornithopter into its
# graveyard with Wheel of Fortune on turn 1, then casts the Summoner on turn 3, Accepts the "may" and Declines the library, so only the
# graveyard is searched. Grizzly Bears is the only card there with no abilities: Llanowar Elves has an activated ability, Ornithopter a
# keyword and Wheel of Fortune is no creature, and the Hill Giant waiting in the library is out of reach. The library was not searched, so
# it is not shuffled and keeps its order.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Wheel of Fortune
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Fang-Druid Summoner
Plains x3
Island
Swamp
Hill Giant
Island x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fang-Druid Summoner.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline
! Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
! Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Choose(Wheel of Fortune)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Hand = Grizzly Bears; Island; Plains; Plains; Plains; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Wheel of Fortune; Ornithopter; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Library = Hill Giant; Island; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Fang-Druid Summoner.Keywords = Reach
